<title>AUSTRALIA: Foxtel to unveil late night adult movies.</title>
<headline>Foxtel to unveil late night adult movies.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian pay television operator Foxtel, which is jointly owned by News Corp Ltd and Telstra Corp Ltd said on Wednesday it planned to show adult movie channel Nightmoves from July 1.</p>
<p>Foxtel said the Australian Broadcasting Authority has approved Foxtel's carriage of Nightmoves, which shows R-rated movies and features of a non-violent erotic nature.</p>
<p>It said Nightmoves, which is also shown on the Galaxy satellite service owned by Australis Media Ltd, will only be shown from 11 p.m. to 4 a.m.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
